sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Member as Team member (Mary Tan)
    participant UI as Browser
    participant App as Django app
    participant DB as Database

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.06)
    Note over Member,DB: 001 Sign-in and hotel access
    Member->>UI: Sign in as Mary Tan
    UI->>App: Sign in
    App-->>UI: Meetings of Hotel A only
    end

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.12)
    Note over Member,DB: 002 Weekly meetings
    Member->>UI: New meeting: date, chair, attendees
    UI->>App: Create the meeting
    App->>DB: Save it (one meeting per hotel per date)
    end

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.06)
    Note over Member,DB: 004 Carry forward · 005 Overdue and counts
    App->>DB: Open, In progress and Blocked actions from earlier meetings
    App->>App: Work out overdue from each due date and today
    App-->>UI: Meeting screen: carried forward, raised, overdue counts
    end

    rect rgba(127,255,212,0.12)
    Note over Member,DB: 003 Action items
    Member->>UI: Add action: segment, category, issue, action, owner, due
    UI->>App: Save the action
    App->>App: Check the required fields
    App->>DB: Save it with its change history
    App-->>UI: The action appears under "Raised in this meeting"
    end
